      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Oh, I'm just curious about you. What do you like to do for fun? I heard that hiking is really popular.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T08:36:14.165129+00:00"
    },
    {
