      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "I'm just a girl, I like to read books. I love mysteries, I was just reading something about an interesting mystery novel last week.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T08:38:04.823407+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Oh, I see. So, you're into hiking too? I've always wanted to try it, but maybe a bit of planning would be necessary.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T08:38:38.031466+00:00"
    },
    {
