      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "I'm just a girl, I like to read books. I loved this mystery novel you mentioned!",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T08:42:43.505882+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Oh, I see! So, you're into reading and hiking too? Maybe we can go on a hike together sometime.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T08:43:18.684399+00:00"
    },
    {
