      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "I love mysteries! That sounds like a great hobby. Maybe we can start by looking for some interesting trails that are known for their mysterious locations and stories.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-09T08:58:49.400983+00:00"
